---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'How DevKDP handles your data. Short answer: we don\'t collect personal information; tool inputs and uploaded files stay in your browser.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/privacy/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-05-08</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Short version</h2>
    <p>DevKDP and the kdp.cool family of tools run entirely in your browser. We do not ask for accounts, do not collect personal information, and do not sell data. JSON you paste, files you upload, and Base64 strings you decode all stay on your device.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What we collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Anonymous traffic analytics</strong> via Cloudflare's built-in Web Analytics (no cookies, no fingerprinting).</li>
      <li><strong>Tool state in URL parameters</strong> when applicable — for example, the JSON formatter persists your indent preference. Nothing is sent to a server beyond the static page request.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising</strong> via Google AdSense. AdSense may use cookies and third-party identifiers to serve personalized ads, subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">Google's privacy policy</a>. You can opt out of personalized ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What we don't collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li>Email addresses</li>
      <li>Names</li>
      <li>The JSON, Base64, or files you input into our tools (they never leave your browser)</li>
      <li>Account credentials (we have no accounts)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Cookies</h2>
    <p>DevKDP itself does not set cookies. Google AdSense may set cookies to serve and measure ads. If you're in the EU, EEA, or UK, AdSense will show a consent prompt before personalized ads are served.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Children</h2>
    <p>DevKDP is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect any information from children.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Your rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
    <p>Because we don't store personal information, there's typically nothing to access, delete, or export. If you have questions, see Contact below.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we'll update the "Last updated" date above. Material changes will be highlighted on the homepage.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/contact/" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">Contact</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
